opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis:
  "Name screening against public sanctions lists: parsers, normalisation, fuzzy matching, index, cases"
description:
  "Parses the OFAC SDN list (CSV and advanced XML, streamed), the EU consolidated list (XML), the UK Sanctions List (XML) and the archived UK OFSI consolidated list (CSV); normalises names across Latin, Cyrillic, Greek and Arabic script; scores them with explainable integer components; indexes every list name for millisecond screening; decides Clear, Potential_match or Confirmed; rescreens a population on a list update; and runs a case lifecycle with optional four eyes. Bundles invented fixture lists for tests and demos. Includes the sanctions-screening command."
